      "id": "word-sea--subjunctive-ser",
      "kind": "word",
      "promptEs": "sea",
      "answerEn": "is; may be (a possibility form of ser)",
      "noteEn": "Sea is a form of ser used when something is presented as uncertain, possible, desired, or otherwise not stated as a plain fact. For a straightforward statement, the corresponding form is es.",
      "example": {
        "es": "Puede que sea cierto.",
        "en": "It may be true."
      },
